{"alias":"/funding/reports/expenditures","title":"School Administrative Unit Expenditures by Budget Category","changed":"2026-06-04T16:24:41+00:00","before":"<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>Resident Expenditures by Budget Categories</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>Resident Expenditures by Budget Categories for each school administrative unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Resident Expenditures by Budget Categories Report is based on all general fund expenditures and revenues annually reported by each school administrative unit to the Maine Department of Education in the Maine Education Financial System (MEFS) separated into the statutorily required eleven budget categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Since this report is based only on resident/subsidizable pupils, any tuition receipts have been deducted from the expenditure data.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For the Resident Expenditure by Budget Category - Per-Pupil Report, expenditures are divided by the resident pupil count as collected on October 1 of the year of the report in the DOE Student Information System.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Prior to FY18, the resident pupil count was an average of the October 1 and April 1 resident students (for which a school administrative unit is financially responsible) reported to the Maine Department of Education's Student Information System.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/BudgetCategoriesModelChartAccts%20template.xlsx\">Budget Category Template</a> (Excel)</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>2024-2025</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20FY25%20Resident%20Expenditure%20Percentage%20of%20Total%20-%201.7.2026.pdf\">Percentage of Total</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20FY25%20Resident%20Expenditure%20Per%20Pupil%20-%201.7.2026.pdf\">Pupil Expenditures</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"6b3105ec-2c72-4663-9cc3-54965dccff1a\" filename=\"School Finance - FY25 Resident Expenditure Totals - 6.3.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20FY25%20Resident%20Expenditure%20Totals%20-%206.3.2026.pdf\">Total Expenditures</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>2023-2024</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Resident%20Expenditure%20By%20Budget%20Category%20Percentage%20of%20Total.pdf\">Percentage of Total</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Resident%20Expenditure%20By%20Budget%20Category%20Per%20Pupil%20Expenditures.pdf\">Pupil Expenditures</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Resident%20Expenditure%20By%20Budget%20Category%20Total%20Expenditures.pdf\">Total Expenditures</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>2022-2023</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Resident%20Expenditure%20Percentage%20of%20Total%20-%201.8.2024.pdf\">Percentage of Total</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Resident%20Expenditure%20Pupil%20Expenditures%20-%201.8.2024.pdf\">Pupil Expenditures</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Finance%20-%20Resident%20Expenditure%20Total%20Expenditures%20-%201.8.2024.pdf\">Total Expenditures</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Fiscal Reports</p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">Resident Expenditures by Budget Categories for each school administrative unit.</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"resident-expenditures-by-budget-categories\">\r\n<h2>Resident Expenditures by Budget Categories</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>The Resident Expenditures by Budget Categories Report is based on all general fund expenditures and revenues annually reported by each school administrative unit to the Maine Department of Education in the Maine Education Financial System (MEFS) separated into the statutorily required eleven budget categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Since this report is based only on resident/subsidizable pupils, any tuition receipts have been deducted from the expenditure data.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For the Resident Expenditure by Budget Category - Per-Pupil Report, expenditures are divided by the resident pupil count as collected on October 1 of the year of the report in the DOE Student Information System.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Prior to FY18, the resident pupil count was an average of the October 1 and April 1 resident students (for which a school administrative unit is financially responsible) reported to the Maine Department of Education's Student Information System.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/BudgetCategoriesModelChartAccts%20template.xlsx\">Budget Category Template</a> <span class=\"doe-chip\">Excel</span></p>\r\n\r\n<d